                                    // (client 15.535.29: 14 of 14 dash ends; sp-champ-BossBandit-s0 t224).
                                    // PLANT (regression) dash_range_reads_start: the new arm reads the start-of-tick point.
                                    #[cfg(not(clash_plant = "dash_range_reads_start"))]
